      "title": "Ocarina of Time is out today on Switch 2, with a 96 on Metacritic",
      "tags": [
        "Switch 2"
      ],
      "body": "The remake launches today at £58.99 / $69.99, and reviewers love it: 5/5 from Eurogamer, GamesRadar and VGC, 9/10 from IGN and Nintendo Life. The main gripe is that there's no Master Quest. Grab the 343MB day-one patch, which adds Zelda Notes support. Digital Foundry says it holds a steady 60fps.",
